This updated strategy aims to balance reactiveness with stability and proactive adjustment, learning from both the successes and failures of previous strategies. It also introduces a more adaptive approach to handling extreme tilt scenarios, acknowledging that one-size-fits-all corrections may not be optimal in all situations.
