   * ELSE IF Pole Angle < 0 AND Cart Position > 0 THEN move right (2)
   * ELSE move in the opposite direction of the pole angle (i.e., if pole angle is positive, move left; if pole angle is negative, move right)

The main changes are:

* Increased the threshold for pole angle and angular velocity to reduce unnecessary actions
* Added a new rule to move in the opposite direction of the cart velocity when it's high
